                "message": "Add sp-cite-match and sp-reading for macOS, with a Hammerspoon hotkey\n\nMatches a selected citation to the BibTeX records, writes a Cited works\nsection into the litnote, receives the text through org-protocol, and opens\nor indexes the work in DEVONthink.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCcNep549ieuxU71WK",
